(7643321, 1241864, 124815, '<td valign="top">I find this extraordinary. <br/>Very powerful, it has the obstinate feel of a prehistoric animal and yet the mind rushes to a Durer drawing. <br/>This is beyond "Brown", the way I believe challenges shall be approached. <br/>Meeting a challenge but finding a way to surprise, to inform, to delight, to puzzle.<br/>10 and a handshake</td>', 'I find this extraordinary. Very powerful, it has the obstinate feel of a prehistoric animal and yet the mind rushes to a Durer drawing. This is beyond "Brown", the way I believe challenges shall be approached. Meeting a challenge but finding a way to surprise, to inform, to delight, to puzzle.10 and a handshake', '2019-10-08 18:51:48.000000', NULL, 1),
