(7643459, 1241896, 5628, '<td valign="top">I think this has the potential to do well. I would have liked just a little more DOF, but the part that is in focus, is nice and sharp.</td>', 'I think this has the potential to do well. I would have liked just a little more DOF, but the part that is in focus, is nice and sharp.', '2019-10-11 05:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7643460, 1241835, 5628, '<td valign="top">I like this image, despite it being a little cluttered. I think you tried to include too many elements in the shot. A simpler composition, with a slightly more interesting angle would have bumped this up even higher for me.</td>', 'I like this image, despite it being a little cluttered. I think you tried to include too many elements in the shot. A simpler composition, with a slightly more interesting angle would have bumped this up even higher for me.', '2019-10-11 05:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
