(7643565, 1241883, 124815, '<td valign="top">I love the busyness, the almost abstract look, the processing and needless to say, the capture<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2019-10-14 00:47:34.</i></td>', 'I love the busyness, the almost abstract look, the processing and needless to say, the capture', '2019-10-14 01:13:55.000000', '2019-10-14 01:47:34.000000', 0),
(7643566, 1241835, 124815, '<td valign="top">No intention to be a contrarian, but what I like here is the lack of tidiness, the capture of a candid moment . Somehow I have the inkling that you did place the objects the way we see them and not that you found them in their apparent disarray, but you pretended well<br/>The dof works beautifully and the steam here and there can be almost smelled<br/>All in all, a good, not posed still life</td>', 'No intention to be a contrarian, but what I like here is the lack of tidiness, the capture of a candid moment . Somehow I have the inkling that you did place the objects the way we see them and not that you found them in their apparent disarray, but you pretended wellThe dof works beautifully and the steam here and there can be almost smelledAll in all, a good, not posed still life', '2019-10-14 01:29:02.000000', NULL, 0),
